        {
          "text": "I proposed one payment for Northwind. It needs your approval before any money moves.\n\n**Proposed**\n- **PAY-001 for INV-101:** 1,250.50 USDC to Northwind Energy Supplies' registered payout address, 0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69. The invoice is due 2026-11-15.\n\n**Not proposed**\n- **INV-105 (990.00 USDC):** This invoice is already marked paid, so there's nothing left to pay.\n\n**Checks**\n- Northwind is an active vendor, and no other payment had been proposed for INV-101.\n- The treasury holds 100,000.00 USDC, which covers this payment.\n- The vendor's message on INV-101 is a normal billing note. It doesn't ask for anything unusual, like a different payment address.\n\nINV-101 was the only open invoice from Northwind, so once you approve PAY-001, nothing more is owed to them.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
